  "statement": "Performance efficiency is indeed critical, and I appreciate SafetyAgent's proposal to relax EFF-01 to 3 seconds. However, I believe we can achieve both safety and performance by keeping EFF-01 at 2 seconds while optimizing the algorithms for efficiency. Additionally, integrating energy-efficient algorithms (GRN-01) should not compromise our system's responsiveness. I suggest we explore solutions that can enhance both security and efficiency without adjusting the strict requirements for real-time processing.",
